  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian scholarships, training, and alumni engagement program in the Philippines (2018&#x2013;2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides Australia Awards scholarships to Filipinos, primarily for postgraduate degrees in Australia as well as short courses delivered in Australia and the Philippines. It also provides professional development opportunities for Australia-educated alumni in the Philippines. The program&#x2019;s objectives include building a cohort of Australia-educated alumni who use the skills, knowledge, and networks gained in Australia to contribute to sustainable development in the Philippines. By fostering people-to-people and institutional links between Australia and the Philippines, it also strengthens bilateral cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
